@Wraith2 the solution file updates are ok but not 100% correct. The Unsafe project is now just a shim and hence doesn't need to be part of the solution files as it's not a "ProjectReference" anymore.

You can either update the solution files yourself with this command: `dotnet.cmd/sh build src/libraries/slngen.proj` which will take a few minutes or let me push a commit to your branch (I already have the changes ready on my machine, based on your PR).
In case you want to do it yourself, it would be cool if you include this change locally before executing the above command so that the solution files don't need to be updated yet again soon: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/65124.
